    },
    {
      "id": "scene_1",
      "text": "You are about to watch the ultimate football prediction.",
      "in_seconds": 6.48,
      "source": "projects/fifa_prediction_project_9/images/[00-06]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "out_seconds": 9.42,
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/ping.mp3",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_2",
      "text": "Spain enters the pitch with six clean sheets, conceding only one goal in the entire tournament.",
      "in_seconds": 9.42,
      "source": "projects/fifa_prediction_project_9/images/[00-09]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "out_seconds": 14.42,
      "animation": "ken-burns",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/pop.mp3",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_3",
      "text": "But Argentina arrives with the magic of late-game comebacks.",
      "in_seconds": 14.42,
      "source": "projects/fifa_prediction_project_9/images/[00-14]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "out_seconds": 17.96,
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/ping.mp3",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_4",
      "text": "Which team will lift the trophy when the dust settles?",
      "in_seconds": 17.96,
      "source": "projects/fifa_prediction_project_9/images/[00-17]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "out_seconds": 20.78,
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/riser.mp3",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_5",
      "text": "The match will start with intense Spanish control.",
      "in_seconds": 20.78,
      "source": "projects/fifa_prediction_project_9/images/[00-20]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "out_seconds": 23.58,
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/pop.mp3",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_6",
      "text": "They will dominate possession.",
      "in_seconds": 23.58,
      "source": "projects/fifa_prediction_project_9/images/[00-23]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "out_seconds": 25.22,
      "animation": "none",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/chime.mp3",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_7",
      "text": "Their young winger Lamine Yamal will break the deadlock in the thirty-fifth minute with a curling shot.",
      "in_seconds": 25.22,
      "source": "projects/fifa_prediction_project_9/images/[00-25]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "out_seconds": 30.02,
      "animation": "ken-burns",
      "sfx": {
        "src": "projects/common_assets/sfx/whoosh.mp3",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "startOffsetSeconds": 0.0
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "scene_8",
      "text": "You will feel Spain's victory is inevitable.",
      "in_seconds": 30.02,
      "source": "projects/fifa_prediction_project_9/images/[00-30]_Hand-drawn_2D_doo.jpg",
      "out_seconds": 32.54,
